## 🔒 Sécurité

### Patterns Obligatoires (Server Actions)
```typescript
const ctx = await getUserContext(guildId);
if (!ctx.isAuthenticated) return { success: false, error: "Unauthorized" };
if (!ctx.isMember) return { success: false, error: "Not a member" };
if (!ctx.isAdmin) return { success: false, error: "Admin required" }; // mutations admin
```

### Isolation Multi-tenant
```typescript
// TOUJOURS filtrer par guildId
await db.entity.findMany({ where: { guildId: guildConfig.id, ...otherFilters } });
```

